{{dercat|de|gem-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|-}} and {{inh|de|goh|mīn}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*mīn}}. Compare {{cog|en|my}} and {{m|en|mine}}.

===Pronunciation===
